{{DECL}}
{{SHARED}}

// =============================================================================
//  PRICE ACTION MTF  -  v1.0.0
//  Indicator Price Action + hoi tu da khung (MTF confluence) theo phuong phap
//  "Nh Kien Thuc Trading" - docs/indicator/price-action-mtf/
//  (copy-on-write tu TM XAU Signals 2 / parts-xau2, KHONG sua ban cu)
//
//  Layer structure:
//    L0  CONFIG       - input nhom (Moi tinh nang co toggle rieng)
//    L1  CORE         - ATR/ATR%, volume VSA, RelVol, OBV, EMA 20/50/200,
//                       displacement, pivots, session detect
//    L2  MARKET STR   - Swing, HH/HL/LH/LL, BOS, CHoCH, MSS, Retest,
//                       Failed Breakout, Continuation, Pullback  -> UDT PaEvent
//                       + B-P0-1: Double/Triple Top-Bottom + Vai dau vai
//    L3  LIQUIDITY    - PDH/PDL, PWH/PWL, Session Hi/Lo, Equal Hi/Lo, Sweep,
//                       Trendline 2 diem (touchCount/slope/break)
//    L4  ZONES        - S/R zones + FVG + Order Block (tuong doi, rieng toggle)
//    L5  CANDLE       - Pin, Engulfing, Displacement, Rejection
//                       + B-P0-2: Inside bar / Doji / 3 Soldiers-Crows
//                       + B-P1-1: volume veto nguong High (ratio >= 1.2)
//                       + B-P1-4: dem chuoi engulfing
//    L6  INDICATORS   - nhom theo chuc nang:
//                       Trend / Momentum(RSI+MACD+DMI) / Volatility(ATR%+BBW) /
//                       Volume(RelVol+OBV+VSA) / Location(VWAP+day range)
//    L7  MTF CONTEXT  - Context TF (H4/D/W/M) + Setup TF (H1/M15); entry = chart
//                       TF - LTF khong duoc override HTF (co VETO ro rang)
//    L8  SCORING      - 0-100, 11 nhom trong so tong 100 + B-P0-3 CONFLUENCE 0-3
//                       (trend + level + xac nhan) - alert `setup` chi khi 3/3
//    L9  RISK         - Entry/SL/TP plan + gate (+ B-P1-2 regime gate,
//                       B-P1-3 measured-move TP)
//    L10 STATE        - position lifecycle
//    L11 VIZ          - dashboard chuan parts-xau/80_viz.pine (table.clear +
//                       key gray-10 / value silver / nen trong suot + dong Session)
//    L12 ALERTS       - webhook JSON: moi event kem {kind,dir,ts,tf,confirmed,level}
//                       + PA MTF SETUP (confluence 3/3) + PA MTF PATTERN
//
//  Core principles:
//    - No repaint on confirmed signals (barstate.isconfirmed gate)
//    - No future data leakage (request.security [1] + lookahead_on)
//    - Moi event UDT PaEvent: source timestamp + timeframe + confirmed + level
//    - Tat ca nguong/trong so deu configurable (khong hard-code)
//    - Toggle OFF moi afterfix => hanh vi TRUNG ban cu (parts-xau2)
// =============================================================================
